Package: FoRDM
Type: Package
Title: Forest multi-objective Robust Decision Making (FoRDM)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Marc", family = "Djahangard", email = "marc.djahangard@ife.uni-freiburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre")), person(given = "Rasoul", family = "Yousefpour", role = c("aut")))
Maintainer: Marc Djahangard <marc.djahangard@ife.uni-freiburg.de>
Description: This package provides a toolkit for forest research and management related many-objective Robust Decision Making (FoRDM)
    analysis under deep uncertainty. It includes robustness measure calculation of regret-based (Type II and cVaR) and satisficing-based as well as robustness
    trade-off analysis to support decision making in forest ecosystems under deep uncertainty.
